[10.736, "o", "\u001b[0;36m> using podman container \u00b7 asking opencode \u00b7 using deepseek-v4-flash-free\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[13.236, "o", "\u001b[0m\r\n> build \u00b7 deepseek-v4-flash-free\r\n\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[15.736, "o", "\u001b[0m\u2699 \u001b[0mard-google-discovery_ard_search {\"query\":\"SQL query optimization, query analyzer, performance insights\"}\r\n"]
[15.866, "o", "\u001b[0m\u2699 \u001b[0mard-google-discovery_ard_search {\"query\":\"zero-trust security, IAM policies, access management, VPC service controls\"}\r\n"]
[18.366, "o", "Here are the best matches:\r\n\r\n**SQL Query Optimization:**\r\n- **BigQuery SQL & Performance Guidelines Skill** (tier 0, no auth) \u2014 partitioning/clustering, window functions, schema design. Best for best-practice guidance: `urn:ai:google.com:skills:bigquery-guidelines`\r\n- **BigQuery Managed MCP Server** (tier 3, GCP) \u2014 live query execution + dry-run cost estimation. Needs `gcloud auth application-default login`\r\n- **Cloud SQL / AlloyDB / Spanner MCPs** (tier 3) \u2014 for managed SQL engines if you run those\r\n\r\n**Zero-Trust Security:**\r\n- **Well-Architected Security Skill** (tier 0, no auth) \u2014 zero-trust patterns, IAM least-privilege, network perimeters, encryption: `urn:ai:google.com:skills:well-architected-security`\r\n- **gcp-auth-recipes Skill** (tier 0) \u2014 ADC, Workload Identity Federation for zero-trust identities\r\n- **Secret Manager MCP** (tier 3) \u2014 if you need to store/rotate secrets\r\n\r\nThe two tier-0 skills (BigQuery guidelines + Security) work immediately offline with no auth \u2014 ideal for the best-practices guidance you asked for. Want me to load either one?\r\n"]
