[72.485, "o", "\u001b[0m\u2699 \u001b[0mard-google-discovery_ard_search {\"query\":\"query a public BigQuery dataset with SQL\"}\r\n"]
[74.763, "o", "The **Google BigQuery Managed MCP Server** (`urn:ai:google.com:mcp:bigquery`) can do this \u2014 it handles SQL execution, schema inspection, and public dataset exploration (e.g. `bigquery-public-data`). It needs GCP credentials, but the free tier includes 1TB of monthly query processing.\r\n\r\nLet me check your current auth state\r\n"]
[74.787, "o", "\u001b[0m\u2699 \u001b[0mard-google-discovery_ard_auth_status Unknown\r\n"]
[76.84, "o", "You're not authenticated yet. To use the BigQuery MCP server, you'd need to onboard with GCP credentials (`gcloud auth application-default login`). It's free tier \u2014 1TB of query processing/month.\r\n\r\nDo you want to allow access to this service? If so I'll record your consent and give you the exact commands.\r\n"]
[78.87, "o", "\u001b[?2004hdeveloper@workstation:~/ard-project$ "]
